00:49:53,400 --> 00:49:55,320
INGRESANDO A CIUDAD ZOMBI

764
00:49:57,440 --> 00:49:58,440
Hola.

765
00:49:59,000 --> 00:50:00,040
Viniste.

766
00:50:00,240 --> 00:50:02,840
